<template><div class="learning-metro-map"><p class="workspace-caption">线路表示保存的学习顺序；完成状态只使用任务确认或可归因练习记录，不从模型估计推算。</p><ol><li v-for="(stage,index) in stages" :key="stage.id" :class="`metro-stop--${stage.state}`"><div class="metro-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>{{ stage.state==='done'?'✓':String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') }}</span></div><article><button class="metro-stop-button" :aria-expanded="expanded===stage.id" @click="expanded=expanded===stage.id?'':stage.id"><span><strong>{{ stage.title }}</strong><small>{{ stage.stateLabel }}</small></span><ChevronDown :size="18"/></button><div v-if="expanded===stage.id" class="metro-stop-detail"><p>{{ stage.details }}</p><p v-if="stage.total!==null">用户确认完成 {{ stage.completed }} / {{ stage.total }} 项任务</p><p v-else>该阶段没有已关联的任务完成标准，不显示完成百分比。</p><slot name="details" :stage="stage"/><button class="workspace-text-action" @click="emit('select',stage.id)">查看关联知识与下一步 →</button></div></article></li></ol><div v-if="!stages.length" class="workspace-empty"><Waypoints :size="30"/><h3>你的路线，等待第一个起点。</h3><p>选择已有目标或生成学习路径后，会出现真实站点。</p><RouterLink to="/learn?tab=plan" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost m-btn--sm">制定长期学习计划</RouterLink></div></div></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { ref,watch } from 'vue'
import { ChevronDown,Waypoints } from 'lucide-vue-next'
export interface MetroStage{id:string;title:string;state:string;stateLabel:string;details:string;completed:number|null;total:number|null}
const props=defineProps<{stages:MetroStage[]}>(),emit=defineEmits<{select:[id:string]}>(),expanded=ref('')
watch(()=>props.stages,stages=>{if(!stages.some(s=>s.id===expanded.value))expanded.value=stages.find(s=>s.state!=='done')?.id||stages[0]?.id||''},{immediate:true})
</script>
<style scoped>.learning-metro-map>ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:24px 0}.learning-metro-map li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;position:relative}.metro-line{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center}.metro-line::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:4px;top:36px;bottom:-2px;background:var(--m-primary-border);border-radius:4px}.learning-metro-map li:last-child .metro-line::after{display:none}.metro-line>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:35px;height:35px;background:var(--m-bg);border:2px solid var(--m-border-strong);border-radius:50%;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px;position:relative;z-index:1}.metro-stop--done .metro-line>span{border-color:var(--m-success);color:var(--m-success)}.metro-stop--review .metro-line>span{border-color:var(--m-gold);color:var(--m-gold)}.metro-stop--evidence .metro-line>span,.metro-stop--learning .metro-line>span{border-color:var(--m-primary);color:var(--m-primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--m-primary-soft)}.learning-metro-map li>article{padding-bottom:20px;min-width:0}.metro-stop-button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:6px 0 16px;width:100%;text-align:left;color:var(--m-text);background:none;border:0;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.metro-stop-button strong{font-size:17px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.6}.metro-stop-button small{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--m-text-faint)}.metro-stop-detail{border:1px solid var(--m-border);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;background:var(--m-bg)}.metro-stop-detail p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--m-text-dim)}</style>
